    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Ready to BOUNCE!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/b27a61a46f457a3bab70fdfee98885d4.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JUMP INTO THE COLORFUL WORLD OF <strong>BOUNCY ESCAPE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and outpace other players across multiple game modes - what will you choose? Parkour Race? Sumo battles? Soccer? Or maybe a chaotic dash across endless streets, dodging cars as you race forward? Play <strong>locally or online</strong> with up to four players. Get ready! The countdown begins in <strong>3...2...1...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UPGRADE AND STAND OUT AMONG OTHER PLAYERS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win a round? Earn <strong>coins</strong>! Use them in the shop to buy double jumps and get even better than your opponents... Or maybe you'd rather use emojis to express your feelings to other players?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY WITH FRIENDS AND FAMILY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you how you want to play \u2013 <strong>locally</strong> with split-screen or <strong>ONLINE</strong> with friends or other players? You can create a private lobby for invited players only, or join a public lobby to compete against players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENDLESS ADVENTURE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve got lots of game modes and maps for you, so the fun never gets boring... Which map will you be the best at?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/f4c85e2ebfb263373b20ef7fe2401eb0.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOUNCY RACE <i>(local &amp; online)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3...2...1... Who will reach the finish line first? On this floating map, anyone can fall into the void... Will you overcome all the obstacles and cross the <strong>finish</strong> <strong>line?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/7a71251f549877d5b296494ba84d4272.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CROSS THE ROAD <i>(local &amp; online)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic chaos awaits! <strong>Dash</strong> across endless roads, dodge speeding cars, and don\u2019t get flattened! The farther you go, the harder it gets. Will you outrun your friends and become the ultimate road crosser?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/899ccd18ea6d3bd3badda7a6ab190410.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FLOOR FALL\u00a0 <i>(local &amp; online)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The floor is collapsing beneath your feet! <strong>Run, jump, and dodge</strong> to avoid falling into the void as the floor disappears piece by piece. Can you outlast all the other players and be the last one standing? The longer you survive, the more intense it gets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/0adb9bb300aef1058f46988e0dfe3623.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOAL RUSH <i>(local &amp; online)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone loves sports... two nets, two teams, and one ball! Which team will score more and win the <strong>football</strong> showdown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/9c38f8c77d06d60b38c384986f92bc9a.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUMO <i>(local)</i><br>Time is ticking... and the platform is shrinking! Will you manage to knock off all the players and become the <strong>Sumo King</strong>? There can only be one winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/61f3cbff7d306648882459d5161ac734.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENDLESS RUN <i>(local)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many platforms can you jump across? This endless, randomly generated world will test you! Choose the game type that suits you best... mysterious boosters that increase your character? Or maybe you want to <strong>challenge</strong> yourself in the timed mode and see how many platforms you can jump in a set time? It's time to decide!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Ready to BOUNCE!</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/b27a61a46f457a3bab70fdfee98885d4.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >JUMP INTO THE COLORFUL WORLD OF <strong>BOUNCY ESCAPE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and outpace other players across multiple game modes - what will you choose? Parkour Race? Sumo battles? Soccer? Or maybe a chaotic dash across endless streets, dodging cars as you race forward? Play <strong>locally or online</strong> with up to four players. Get ready! The countdown begins in <strong>3...2...1...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UPGRADE AND STAND OUT AMONG OTHER PLAYERS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win a round? Earn <strong>coins</strong>! Use them in the shop to buy double jumps and get even better than your opponents... Or maybe you'd rather use emojis to express your feelings to other players?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PLAY WITH FRIENDS AND FAMILY</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you how you want to play \u2013 <strong>locally</strong> with split-screen or <strong>ONLINE</strong> with friends or other players? You can create a private lobby for invited players only, or join a public lobby to compete against players from around the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENDLESS ADVENTURE</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve got lots of game modes and maps for you, so the fun never gets boring... Which map will you be the best at?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/f4c85e2ebfb263373b20ef7fe2401eb0.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOUNCY RACE <i>(local &amp; online)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3...2...1... Who will reach the finish line first? On this floating map, anyone can fall into the void... Will you overcome all the obstacles and cross the <strong>finish</strong> <strong>line?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/7a71251f549877d5b296494ba84d4272.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CROSS THE ROAD <i>(local &amp; online)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traffic chaos awaits! <strong>Dash</strong> across endless roads, dodge speeding cars, and don\u2019t get flattened! The farther you go, the harder it gets. Will you outrun your friends and become the ultimate road crosser?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/899ccd18ea6d3bd3badda7a6ab190410.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FLOOR FALL\u00a0 <i>(local &amp; online)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The floor is collapsing beneath your feet! <strong>Run, jump, and dodge</strong> to avoid falling into the void as the floor disappears piece by piece. Can you outlast all the other players and be the last one standing? The longer you survive, the more intense it gets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/0adb9bb300aef1058f46988e0dfe3623.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOAL RUSH <i>(local &amp; online)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone loves sports... two nets, two teams, and one ball! Which team will score more and win the <strong>football</strong> showdown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/9c38f8c77d06d60b38c384986f92bc9a.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SUMO <i>(local)</i><br>Time is ticking... and the platform is shrinking! Will you manage to knock off all the players and become the <strong>Sumo King</strong>? There can only be one winner!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3256880/extras/61f3cbff7d306648882459d5161ac734.avif?t=1743991824\" data-has-big width=800 height=232 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ENDLESS RUN <i>(local)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How many platforms can you jump across? This endless, randomly generated world will test you! Choose the game type that suits you best... mysterious boosters that increase your character? Or maybe you want to <strong>challenge</strong> yourself in the timed mode and see how many platforms you can jump in a set time? It's time to decide!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
